# {project_title} — Conventions

This repository was onboarded onto alan with the **dotnet** stack preset.
`dotnet restore` fetches NuGet packages; `dotnet build`/`dotnet test` build and
run the test suite.

## Commands

```bash
dotnet restore
dotnet build
dotnet test
dotnet format --verify-no-changes
```

## Gates (CI, `.github/workflows/ci.yml`)

The `dotnet-ci` check runs on every pull request and must pass before merge:

- `dotnet build`
- `dotnet test`
- `dotnet format --verify-no-changes`

## Dependencies

Dependabot (`.github/dependabot.yml`) opens weekly update pull requests for both
NuGet packages and GitHub Actions.
